MODULE: RepairAckBeforeCheckpoint
TARGET: AckEntitled
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: acknowledgement is sent before durable checkpoint retirement
PERTURBS: Acknowledge

--- FIND
    /\ Live /\ repairApplied /\ v \in retired /\ v \notin acknowledged
--- REPLACE
    /\ Live /\ repairApplied /\ v \notin acknowledged
--- END
